#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:2
#: 596423c8d92e4592b221947ca5595ea7
msgid "The TCP Client APIs"
msgstr "TCP 客户端 API"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:5
#: bf347a93657146d6b019250273bc439c
msgid "TCP Client setup API"
msgstr "TCP 客户端设置 API"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:7
#: 7e3dc9343f554fc181d2c2853898916c
msgid ""
"The TCP Client Setup API is used to create a TCP client. The client in "
"the protocol is usually used to connect to the TCP server and exchange "
"data with the server."
msgstr "TCP 客户端设置 API 用于创建 TCP 客户端。协议中的客户端通常用于连接TCP服务器并与服务器交换数据。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:38
#: fb61c59ca5e646f3b749359b2ea13a40
msgid ""
"The TCP Client Setup API is defined in the ``TCP_Client_Base`` class. The"
" parameters of the ``__init__`` method are as follows:"
msgstr "TCP 客户端设置 API 在“TCP_Client_Base”类中定义。 ``__init__``方法的参数如下："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:41
#: d8b55d105dd144198594dd4f454fe5c5
msgid "``host``: The server host IP address to connect to."
msgstr "``host``：要连接的服务器主机 IP 地址。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:42
#: ee9f5f584e6643529cdca91384562ebf
msgid "``client_host``: The local host IP address to bind the client socket to."
msgstr "``client_host``：将客户端套接字绑定到的本地主机 IP 地址。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:43
#: 03357b8c2f974a419c6933d68976b6eb
msgid "``port``: The server port number to connect to."
msgstr "``port``：要连接的服务器端口号。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:44
#: cd50ed1b09934f3bae2a4c615187d157
msgid ""
"``client_port``: The local port number to bind the client socket to "
"(``None`` means let the OS choose)."
msgstr "``client_port``：将客户端套接字绑定到的本地端口号（``None`` 意味着让操作系统选择）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:45
#: f8cdf36b87834ea7a95209d2ca048332
msgid ""
"``timeout``: The socket timeout in seconds for connection and receive "
"operations. ``None`` (the default) is not \"no timeout\": the socket then"
" uses a fixed 5-second timeout, and receive timeouts are swallowed by the"
" receive loop (it simply continues)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:46
#: 20c7ea1afac14f80a2b739cb6ae1957f
msgid ""
"``port_add_step``: The step size for incrementing the port number (used "
"only in manual allocation mode)."
msgstr "``port_add_step``：增加端口号的步长（仅在手动分配模式下使用）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:47
#: eb06f09e560543e5ba0abb3627a63585
msgid ""
"``max_thread_num``: The maximum number of threads for concurrent file "
"transfer operations."
msgstr "``max_thread_num``：并发文件传输操作的最大线程数。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:48
#: 5ff72dc0ec90411bb0d20f618d015093
msgid ""
"``is_input_command_in_console``: A flag indicating whether to input "
"commands in the console (interactive mode)."
msgstr "``is_input_command_in_console``：指示是否在控制台中输入命令的标志（交互模式）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:49
#: 5e12aa05eb854b15b0b6779b40b5a302
msgid ""
"``is_wait_server``: A flag indicating whether to keep retrying connection"
" until the server is available."
msgstr "``is_wait_server``：指示是否继续重试连接直到服务器可用的标志。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:50
#: b3232047b364478caad5b3e5361e71be
msgid "``max_custom_workers``: The maximum number of custom worker threads."
msgstr "``max_custom_workers``：自定义工作线程的最大数量。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:51
#: a951c5564286432082b3e6a06aae8a48
msgid ""
"``is_extend_command``: A flag for extension protocols. With ``False`` "
"(the default) the constructor starts the client itself by calling "
"``start_TCP_client()``; with ``True`` it does not, so an extension can "
"register its commands first and connect later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:55
#: fbb5a64713a34d85868f8b8ec549a4ca
msgid ""
"``is_enable_encrypto``: A flag indicating whether the messages exchanged "
"with the server are RSA-encrypted (see :ref:`tcp-client-encrypted-"
"channel-api`)."
msgstr ""
"“is_enable_encrypto”：指示与服务器交换的消息是否经过 RSA 加密的标志（请参阅 tcp-client-encrypted-"
"channel-api）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:57
#: 8ac8a71ca8564a89bb52f882c4fedefc
msgid ""
"``is_custom_keys``: An optional ``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` pair of "
"user-supplied RSA keys. Both files must exist, parse as PEM, and pair "
"with each other; an invalid pair is silently ignored and the default key "
"lookup is used instead (``None`` keeps the default lookup)."
msgstr ""
"``is_custom_keys``：可选的``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` 用户提供的 RSA "
"密钥对。两个文件都必须存在，解析为 PEM，并且相互配对；无效的对将被默默地忽略，并使用默认的键查找（``None`` 保留默认查找）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:61
#: c01569233a864bf0b106a877fb924c27
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``max_mem_buff``: The buffering ceiling in MiB, stored as bytes "
"(``self.max_mem_buff``). It is kept for parity with the server class; the"
" client's forward path does not read it today. The default is 2048."
msgstr "`` max_mem_buff `` ：默认值为`` 2048 `` （与服务器类保持奇偶校验；客户端的前向路径今天不读取它）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:64
#: 10fb41da1af34a539a962083252bdf55
msgid ""
"``recv_messages_chunk_len``: The number of bytes read per receive on the "
"control connection, covering commands and messages. The default is 4096."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:66
#: 1b569fa80b59490dacc6bcdf3a924d60
msgid ""
"``file_transfer_chunk_len``: The chunk size in bytes for streaming a file"
" or folder transfer in either direction. The default is 65536 (64 KiB)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:68
#: ac73e6da7c3044f1bf68aff504142765
msgid ""
"``is_debug``: A flag selecting how much detail is logged. With ``False`` "
"(the default) the client logs command content and execution results only;"
" with ``True`` it also logs the key steps of the execution process."
msgstr ""
"`` is_debug `` ：选择记录多少详细信息的标志。使用`` False `` （默认值） ，客户端仅记录命令内容和执行结果；使用`` "
"True `` ，客户端还记录执行过程的关键步骤。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:71
#: fbb5a64713a34d85868f8b8ec549a4ca
msgid ""
"``is_print_log``: A flag indicating whether the client logs at all. With "
"``False`` it prints nothing, whatever ``is_debug`` says."
msgstr ""
"`` is_print_log `` ：指示客户端是否记录所有日志的标志。对于`` False `` ，它不打印任何内容，无论`` "
"is_debug ``说什么。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:74
#: fa251d2893fa413aac9d5e525df18209
msgid ""
"``is_enable_file_transfer_progress_bar``: A flag indicating whether every"
" running file transfer is tracked in ``file_recv_progress`` (downloads) "
"and ``file_upload_progress`` (uploads). Each entry is a ``[transferred "
"bytes, total bytes, current speed, local file path, peer]`` list keyed by"
" the transfer's fid — ``peer`` is the ``(ip, port)`` of the transfer's "
"original sender (downloads) or receiver (uploads), never the relay of a "
"forwarded transfer. The entry is removed once the transfer ends; an "
"interrupted one keeps its entry (and its partial file) so the reconnect "
"logic can resume it. ``file_trans_progress_file`` names the file under "
"the protocol's ``.Flow`` directory these stores are written to when the "
"connection drops."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:85
#: 3a9f1a8e8b8f45dbb9011b3b0e28cd92
msgid ""
"``is_enable_real_time_network_speed``: A flag indicating whether the "
"protocol's real-time network speed is measured. With ``True`` (the "
"default) every send and receive — the control layer and every temporary "
"connection, file transfers included — feeds ``upload_network_speed`` and "
"``recv_network_speed`` (bytes per second, a rolling average over "
"``NETWORK_SPEED_WINDOW`` seconds). With ``False`` nothing is measured and"
" every speed value is ``None``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:93
#: 3272388be97643f98bada0a995516141
msgid "Every parameter has default values:"
msgstr "每个参数都有默认值："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:95
#: 9fd3d516d31841fd9054a2a3dfcb1ac4
msgid "``host``: Default is ``None`` (must be provided before connecting)"
msgstr "``host``：默认为``None``（必须在连接前提供）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:96
#: ece6c7a48ae74f86b6e207d960c6daa2
msgid "``client_host``: Default is ``'127.0.0.1'``"
msgstr "“client_host”：默认为“127.0.0.1”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:97
#: 8a9d85bb281e43e69ea0ae48363fb8da
msgid "``port``: Default is ``65432``"
msgstr "“端口”：默认为“65432”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:98
#: 4653721a3e8143fea8a43899bb0e6437
msgid ""
"``client_port``: Default is ``None`` (OS assigns ephemeral port). A "
"configured port that cannot be bound — a session that just ended can hold"
" it in the operating system's ``TIME_WAIT`` — is reported and the "
"connection is made from an OS-assigned port instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:102
#: 4439e99a222744a9bca762b5f14b4d74
msgid "``timeout``: Default is ``None``"
msgstr "“超时”：默认为“无”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:103
#: 0b0f6a9551ff4bf28ad02095893db9d8
msgid "``port_add_step``: Default is ``1``"
msgstr "“port_add_step”：默认为“1”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:104
#: bcb1ee681a0f47319338faf71a99adf7
msgid "``max_thread_num``: Default is ``10``"
msgstr "“max_thread_num”：默认为“10”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:105
#: 08471d033b174cf395292c36068d4cb8
msgid "``is_input_command_in_console``: Default is ``True``"
msgstr "“is_input_command_in_console”：默认为“True”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:106
#: bbf2ad3b5e4340c9b481f8af135281e2
msgid "``is_wait_server``: Default is ``True``"
msgstr "``is_wait_server``：默认为``True``"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:107
#: 63f2004d0c5b4fef8cf23eaa7be020b1
msgid "``max_custom_workers``: Default is ``10``"
msgstr "“max_custom_workers”：默认为“10”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:108
#: 682f3bfe7fe0419493c15afe03553247
msgid ""
"``is_extend_command``: Default is ``False`` (when ``True``, ``__init__`` "
"will not call ``start_TCP_client()`` automatically)"
msgstr "“is_extend_command”：默认为“False”（当“True”时，“__init__”不会自动调用“start_TCP_client()”）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:110
#: c723e855f50a4ec3abf45aaae2e02f45
msgid ""
"``is_enable_encrypto``: Default is ``True`` (when ``True``, the client "
"performs an RSA public-key exchange with the server right after "
"connecting and all subsequent messages are encrypted)"
msgstr ""
"“is_enable_encrypto”：默认为“True”（当“True”时，客户端在连接后立即与服务器执行 RSA "
"公钥交换，并且所有后续消息都被加密）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:113
#: 16c586bc40d94d6b9624812993e12579
msgid ""
"``is_custom_keys``: Default is ``None`` (a ``[pub_key_path, "
"pvt_key_path]`` list uses a user-supplied keypair instead of the default "
"``~/.ssh`` / generated keys)"
msgstr ""
"``is_custom_keys``：默认为``None``（``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` "
"列表使用用户提供的密钥对而不是默认的``~/.ssh``/生成的密钥）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:116
#: 682f3bfe7fe0419493c15afe03553247
msgid ""
"``is_debug``: Default is ``False`` (``True`` adds the execution-process "
"lines to the command/result lines)"
msgstr "`` is_debug `` ：默认值为`` False `` （ `` True ``将执行过程行添加到命令/结果行）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:118
#: 682f3bfe7fe0419493c15afe03553247
msgid ""
"``is_print_log``: Default is ``True`` (``False`` silences every line the "
"client would print)"
msgstr "`` is_print_log `` ：默认值为`` True `` （ `` False ``会使客户端打印的每一行保持沉默）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:120
#: 58fc5a7851094fcba7903d9e6cd4e8e7
msgid ""
"``max_mem_buff``: Default is ``2048`` (kept for parity with the server "
"class; the client's forward path does not read it today)"
msgstr "`` max_mem_buff `` ：默认值为`` 2048 `` （与服务器类保持奇偶校验；客户端的前向路径今天不读取它）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:123
#: 08471d033b174cf395292c36068d4cb8
#, fuzzy
msgid "``recv_messages_chunk_len``: Default is ``4096``"
msgstr "“max_custom_workers”：默认为“10”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:124
#: ff70e67852154092b227e2f05357a78d
msgid "``file_transfer_chunk_len``: Default is ``65536`` (64 KiB)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:125
#: bd7d9bb9bbe14bc38eed56c574fc0987
msgid ""
"``is_enable_file_transfer_progress_bar``: Default is ``True`` (``False`` "
"records no transfer progress)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:127
#: 5282067c345342d4872377ec83b3ba95
msgid ""
"``is_enable_real_time_network_speed``: Default is ``True`` (``False`` "
"measures no speed; every speed value is ``None``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:129
#: d10be044603c42e9a26b3164dcb7cb51
msgid ""
"``is_auto_reconnect``: Default is ``False`` (``True`` makes "
"`start_TCP_client` reconnect after the connection drops and resume the "
"interrupted transfers, see :ref:`transfer-pause-and-reconnect`. The dead "
"session's socket is closed abortively first, so a configured "
"``client_port`` can be bound again — Windows refuses it otherwise)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:135
#: 4b99048b2ec14a988fd9b83b23284d25
msgid ""
"The TCP Client Setup API will initialize all the necessary parameters and"
" resources for the TCP client."
msgstr "TCP 客户端设置 API 将为 TCP 客户端初始化所有必需的参数和资源。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:138
#: b7da2a334a9543aa96178bddc8b6855c
msgid ""
"*Note: In the main class of the TCP client setup API, we initialize the "
"`start_TCP_client` method to set up all functions which are needed in the"
" TCP client, including connecting to the server, handling incoming "
"messages, and managing user input.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：在 TCP 客户端设置 API 的主类中，我们初始化 `start_TCP_client` 方法来设置 TCP "
"客户端所需的所有功能，包括连接到服务器、处理传入消息和管理用户输入。*"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:144
#: 0aa6b4133bf54878ad5d35aa8523ae88
msgid ""
"*Note: By default ``TCP_Client_Base.__init__`` calls "
"``start_TCP_client()`` to connect and enter interactive mode. If you set "
"``is_extend_command=True``, the instance will not auto-start and you "
"should call ``start_TCP_client()`` manually when ready.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：默认情况下``TCP_Client_Base.__init__`` 调用``start_TCP_client()`` "
"进行连接并进入交互模式。如果您设置“is_extend_command=True”，实例将不会自动启动，您应该在准备好时手动调用“start_TCP_client()”。*"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:150
#: 7a35992f8c7c410da60029bb06fb054a
msgid ""
"*Note: If you set ``is_wait_server=True``, the ``timeout`` parameter must"
" be ``None``. The constructor will raise a ``ValueError`` if "
"``is_wait_server`` is ``True`` and ``timeout`` is not ``None``.*"
msgstr "*注意：如果设置“is_wait_server=True”，则“timeout”参数必须为“None”。如果“is_wait_server”为“True”且“timeout”不是“None”，则构造函数将引发“ValueError”。*"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:160
#: 35b6f81f408041c4a7e650d3b92957d1
msgid ""
"In the `start_TCP_client` method, we first attempt to connect to the "
"server by calling the `connect` method. If the connection fails and "
"``is_wait_server`` is ``True``, the client will keep retrying; otherwise "
"it will exit."
msgstr "在`start_TCP_client`方法中，我们首先尝试通过调用`connect`方法连接到服务器。如果连接失败并且“is_wait_server”为“True”，客户端将不断重试；否则它将退出。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:165
#: d8e70dde1c62462cb4954eb1ceb50f3a
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"*Note: The client socket is created in the `connect` method (called by "
"`start_TCP_client`), is based on IPv4 and uses the parameters "
"``self.host`` and ``self.port`` which are provided when creating the "
"client instance.*"
msgstr "*注意：在`start_TCP_client`方法中创建的客户端套接字基于IPv4，并使用创建客户端实例时提供的参数“self.host”和“self.port”。*"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:170
#: 80f69db837ec4e1d9bb90bc821019532
msgid ""
"Secondly, according to the ``self.is_input_command_in_console`` "
"parameter, we will either start the interactive input loop "
"(`interactive_mode`) or simply keep the connection alive (no console "
"input)."
msgstr "其次，根据“self.is_input_command_in_console”参数，我们将启动交互式输入循环（“interactive_mode”）或简单地保持连接处于活动状态（无控制台输入）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:175
#: 445af010e93f421099da8d8dd5212210
msgid ""
"After that, if the interactive mode is enabled, the client will read user"
" input from the console and send messages to the server until the "
"connection is closed."
msgstr "之后，如果启用了交互模式，客户端将从控制台读取用户输入并向服务器发送消息，直到连接关闭。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:179
#: 2d4020f99c3c4a4485815c383a0a4bfe
msgid ""
"*Note: There is a global variable ``self.running`` which is set to "
"``True`` after the client successfully connects to the server. The "
"``self.running`` variable is used to control the main receive loop, and "
"it will be set to ``False`` when the client is shutting down.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：有一个全局变量“self.running”，在客户端成功连接到服务器后，该变量将变为“True”。 "
"“self.running”变量用于控制主接收循环，当客户端关闭时它将变为“False”。*"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:185
#: e4de5ae390fc4c1c9a50703299f80356
msgid ""
"The `connect` method will try to establish a TCP connection to the "
"server. If a ``client_port`` is specified, the client will bind to that "
"local port before connecting. The method will handle timeouts and "
"connection refused errors gracefully, especially when ``is_wait_server`` "
"is enabled."
msgstr ""
"`connect` 方法将尝试建立到服务器的 TCP "
"连接。如果指定了“client_port”，客户端将在连接之前绑定到该本地端口。该方法将优雅地处理超时和连接拒绝错误，特别是当启用“is_wait_server”时。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:191
#: 17315c7599be4d2e8d8f62ad4c866eb3
msgid ""
"When the connection is established, a background thread "
"`receive_messages` is started to continuously read data from the server."
msgstr "当连接建立后，会启动一个后台线程receive_messages，不断从服务器读取数据。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:195
#: 26bc6f1cf62947c88fd9de780337d225
msgid "So what can the setup function do if the connection fails?"
msgstr "那么如果连接失败的话setup函数可以做什么呢？"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:197
#: e7519cc6a4124a008a804ecbe9b10453
msgid ""
"First, if the connection attempt times out, the client will either wait "
"and retry (if ``is_wait_server`` is ``True``) or exit with an error."
